  (text "03 TPS62130A 3V3_MAIN buck, TPS7A20 LDOs, branch links" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 7.62 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dc536035-87fe-5e37-a2b7-00befcbdb6ea"))
  (text "TPS62130A per SLVSAG7F 9.2: 2.2uH XFL4020-222MEB, FSW=GND (2.5 MHz), DEF=GND, 312k/100k -> 3.296 V (docs/POWER_RAIL_PLAN.md)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 13.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9ec45b07-cd78-574c-9c44-c553cad13ead"))
  (text "SS/TR: repo text lists 0.1uF (50 ms by Eq.10) - this candidate uses 3.3nF (about 1.65 ms, TI typical); feed-forward C24 3.3nF fitted per repo text. Reviewer to confirm." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 16.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "da5e5781-b967-5c44-bf36-f70bf21f8127"))
  (text "No main power switch/button is specified in the product baseline: buck EN is pulled to PACK_P (always on while the protected pack is present). Product decision gap." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c6e7bb7d-e380-57dc-8f54-919764e92267"))
  (text "3V0_RF_QUIET LDO EN follows the switched 3V3_ADSB domain so the ADS-B analog chain powers down with RP2040 (one-shot proposal)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "15beb047-79fc-5e7a-9a13-03ab8b714e66"))
